codex
A key finding: the RTL currently treats ECALL/EBREAK/other SYSTEM as `illegal` and latches `trap`, while only IRQ/data-misaligned paths update mepc/mcause/mtval and redirect. That is probably a real DUT gap for J14 sync traps, not a comparator issue.
