codex
This riscv-dv checkout uses the Python generator, whose random CSR stream only chooses `mscratch`; the SystemVerilog CSR whitelist is not enough. I’m adding a Python-side M1 target config and will inject a small directed CSR sweep from the same whitelist so the lockstep actually exercises the supported CSRs.
