codex
The Python generator has a local bug when random `C_EBREAK` is enabled (`KeyError: C_EBREAK`). I’m keeping the random illegal stream on and adding a directed 32-bit `ebreak` in the post-generated program; that exercises breakpoint trap without relying on the broken compressed ebreak generator path.
apply patch
