codex
Spike 1.1.1 in this environment stops at M-mode `ecall` even with `mtvec` initialized, so the generated ECALL completion path cannot be used for per-commit continuation. I’m changing only the program terminator back to `write_tohost`; directed `ebreak` and illegal-instruction traps still go through `mtvec` and `mret` in the lockstep stream.
apply patch
