codex
I added the MPP bits to `mstatus` rather than special-casing the comparator; non-timing CSR state must match Spike. I also changed only Spike’s ISA string to include `zicntr`, leaving GCC/riscv-dv at the requested `rv32imc_zicsr_zifencei`.
