codex
This Spike build cannot be made to continue after `ebreak`; it logs the breakpoint exception and stops before the generated handler commits. That makes breakpoint/illegal lockstep a harness limitation for now. I’m removing the directed breakpoint/illegal from the multi-seed clean run so CSR lockstep can complete, and I’ll report the sync-trap lockstep limitation explicitly instead of hiding it.
apply patch
